  "notes": [
    "setPairAddress set _pair and _pairInitialized; stake() requires it, so no account could receive the minted fee share before. Later setDistributionRatio and setBurnRate calls only resized the fee and its split.",
    "Loss is the pair's net WBNB outflow over the attacker's 33 transactions, the last of which (0xf3a66e59) sold the accumulated BOG; liquidity adds, removals and flash swaps net out. Stakers' dilution is not valued separately.",
    "The stake-selector scan to block 7633630 finds no other large staker after the attack; the pair had been emptied to about 1,947 WBNB."
  ],
